  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide life -saving multipurpose cash and targeted protection assistance to 10,104 drought -affected individuals in Somaliland and Puntland enabling vulnerable households to meet urgent basic needs, access timely protection support, and improve safety and dignity, with a particular focus on women, children, Internally Displaced Persons (IDPs), and people with disabilities.</narrative>
